  "rationale": [
    "Uiverse Galaxy is a large HTML/CSS UI pattern archive rather than an FA3 runtime framework.",
    "The useful value is pattern diversity and micro-interaction reference material, not a production dependency.",
    "FA3 production UI must remain native to the FA3 design, accessibility, security, provenance and evidence contracts.",
    "A reference-only classification avoids creating an unnecessary provider or runtime authority.",
    "Per-component intake remains fail-closed and cannot be inferred from admission of the reference source itself."
  ],
